{"sections": [{"title": "Meaning", "icon": "idea", "about": "What happens in the video", "questions": [{"q": "What used to be in this place?", "o": ["A flower bed", "A manhole shaft", "A pool", "A garage"], "a": 1, "e": "In the video: \"Ovde je bila šahta\" — there used to be a manhole here."}, {"q": "Who fell into the manhole?", "o": ["Čičko", "The cameraman Miki", "Aleksandar", "Grandma Zorka"], "a": 1, "e": "In the video: \"upao nam je samo jedan naš drug\" — only one of our friends fell in (the cameraman Miki)."}, {"q": "What is left to bring into the house?", "o": ["Carpets", "Flowers", "Wooden furniture", "Appliances"], "a": 3, "e": "In the video: \"Još nam je ostalo da unesemo belu tehniku\" — we still have to bring in the appliances."}, {"q": "Which cookware brands are mentioned?", "o": ["Metalac and Sigma", "IKEA and Lidl", "Samsung and LG", "Bosch and Gorenje"], "a": 0, "e": "In the video: \"Nemamo samo Metalac, imamo i Sigmu\" — we don't have only Metalac, we also have Sigma."}, {"q": "Who helped this week?", "o": ["The whole street", "Nobody", "Only the crew", "The army"], "a": 0, "e": "In the video: \"Ogromnu pomoć cele ulice smo imali\" — the whole street helped us enormously."}]}, {"title": "Vocabulary", "icon": "translate", "about": "Words from the video and their translations", "questions": [{"t": "Выбери перевод выделенного слова", "q": "Ovde je bila *šahta*.", "o": ["manhole", "door", "stairs", "stove"], "a": 0, "e": "Šahta — manhole."}, {"t": "Выбери перевод выделенного слова", "q": "Naš *snimatelj* Miki je upao.", "o": ["cameraman", "driver", "cook", "builder"], "a": 0, "e": "Snimatelj — cameraman."}, {"t": "Выбери перевод выделенного слова", "q": "Imamo *posuđe* i pokućstvo za kuhinju.", "o": ["clothes", "books", "dishes", "toys"], "a": 2, "e": "Posuđe — dishes."}, {"t": "Выбери перевод выделенного слова", "q": "Sve ovo je *pokućstvo* za kuhinju.", "o": ["tools", "clothes", "household items", "furniture"], "a": 2, "e": "Pokućstvo — household items."}, {"t": "Выбери перевод выделенного слова", "q": "Ove nedelje smo baš *jeli*.", "o": ["ran", "sang", "slept", "ate"], "a": 3, "e": "Jesti — eat, jeli — ate."}]}, {"title": "Grammar", "icon": "puzzle", "about": "Cases and prepositions", "questions": [{"t": "Выбери правильную форму", "q": "Hvala Bogu da sve ide kako ___.", "o": ["trebaš", "trebaju", "trebam", "treba"], "a": 3, "e": "Impersonal treba — «as it should»."}, {"t": "Выбери правильную форму", "q": "Čeka me moj drug sa ___ kutija.", "o": ["gomila", "gomile", "gomilu", "gomilom"], "a": 3, "e": "S + instrumental: sa gomilom."}, {"t": "Выбери правильную форму", "q": "Pomoć cele ___ smo imali.", "o": ["ulice", "ulicom", "ulicu", "ulica"], "a": 0, "e": "Pomoć + genitive: pomoć ulice."}, {"t": "Выбери правильную форму", "q": "Ti onda ređaj ___.", "o": ["tamu", "tama", "tame", "tamo"], "a": 3, "e": "Tamo — the adverb «there»."}, {"t": "Выбери правильную форму", "q": "Od Sigme imamo ___ za kafu.", "o": ["šoljice", "šoljica", "šoljicu", "šoljicom"], "a": 0, "e": "Imamo + accusative pl.: šoljice."}]}]}